<title>GERMANY: Thyssen-Stahl avge monthly turnover falls.</title>
<headline>Thyssen-Stahl avge monthly turnover falls.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Thyssen Stahl AG said on Tuesday that its average monthly turnover in the nine months between October 1995 and June 1996 fell to 896 million marks from 1.01 billion marks a year earlier.</p>
</text>
